10. Create backend/src/services/llmService.js: exports analyzeAgreement(pageTexts, filename) as async function. Builds a prompt string (see prompt spec below). Uses native fetch to POST to `${OPENAI_BASE_URL}/chat/completions` with Authorization header, model, messages array (system + user), response_format: { type: 'json_object' } when model supports it, max_tokens: 4000, temperature: 0.1. Implements retry with exponential backoff (max 3 attempts, 1s/2s/4s delays) on 429 and 5xx responses. On success, extracts choices[0].message.content, calls safeParseLLMOutput from schemas/analysisSchema.js. If Zod parse fails, logs warning and returns the partial raw JSON with a flag { partial: true }. Returns { result: LLMOutput, partial: boolean, tokensUsed: number }.

   FULL LLM PROMPT TO USE:
   System: 'You are a rental agreement analysis assistant. Analyze the provided rental agreement text and extract structured information. Return ONLY valid JSON matching the specified schema. Be precise — only extract information explicitly stated in the document. If a field is not found, set value to "Not Found" and omit page/quotation. For quotations, use exact text from the document (max 200 characters). Page numbers must match the [PAGE N] markers in the input.'

   User prompt template:
   'Analyze this rental agreement and return a JSON object with this exact structure:
   {
     "details": {
       "monthly_rent": { "value": "...", "page": N, "quotation": "..." },
       "security_deposit": { "value": "...", "page": N, "quotation": "..." },
       "start_date": { "value": "...", "page": N, "quotation": "..." },
       "end_date": { "value": "...", "page": N, "quotation": "..." },
       "lease_duration": { "value": "...", "page": N, "quotation": "..." },
       "notice_period": { "value": "...", "page": N, "quotation": "..." },
       "maintenance": { "value": "...", "page": N, "quotation": "..." },
       "rent_escalation": { "value": "...", "page": N, "quotation": "..." },
       "late_payment": { "value": "...", "page": N, "quotation": "..." },
       "early_termination": { "value": "...", "page": N, "quotation": "..." },
       "renewal_terms": { "value": "...", "page": N, "quotation": "..." },
       "utilities": { "value": "...", "page": N, "quotation": "..." },
       "deposit_refund": { "value": "...", "page": N, "quotation": "..." }
     },
     "clauses": {
       "rent_payment": { "status": "found|not_found|needs_review", "page": N, "note": "..." },
       "security_deposit": { ... },
       "lease_duration": { ... },
       "notice_termination": { ... },
       "maintenance_repairs": { ... },
       "utilities": { ... },
       "rent_escalation": { ... },
       "renewal": { ... },
       "property_damage": { ... },
       "signatures_dates": { ... }
     },
     "conditions": [
       { "title": "...", "explanation": "...", "quotation": "...", "page": N, "category": "financial|notice|termination|maintenance|other" }
     ],
     "risk_summary": [
       { "type": "missing|warning|info", "message": "..." }
     ]
   }

   RENTAL AGREEMENT TEXT (with page markers):
   ${pageTexts.map(p => `[PAGE ${p.pageNumber}]\n${p.text}`).join('\n\n')}
   '
